\]

Baraka arrives first, so the waiting time for the winner is the difference between the two times:

\[
\Delta t = t_{\text{Imani}} - t_{\text{Baraka}}
        = 163\,200\text{ min} - 41\,472\text{ min}
        = 121\,728\text{ min}
\]

Thus the winner will wait **121 728** minutes before the loser finishes the race.
